{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythic equipment befitting heroes who wander the land in search of evil: Elarion, Tariq, and Rime. Three unique armor and weapon cosmetics, one for each associated Hero, and a guiding spirit mount that can be ridden by any Hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Supporter Pack is for Fellows who believe in what we\u2019re building and want to see the Fellowship grow stronger and face deadlier threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support directly fuels the continued development of the game, future Heroes, more Dungeons, and new updates for all who fight for the Fellowship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return, you\u2019ll receive this exclusive collection of cosmetic treasures which will never be available by any other means!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Wanderer\u2019s Supporter Pack includes:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elarion\u2019s Drakebound Hunt Ensemble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082980/extras/1dfcb4dc92787470adacde9833522e09.poster.avif?t=1760630202\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082980/extras/1dfcb4dc92787470adacde9833522e09.webm?t=1760630202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082980/extras/1dfcb4dc92787470adacde9833522e09.mp4?t=1760630202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tariq\u2019s Abyssal Touch Ensemble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082980/extras/dcf7c8dd9